hadiths[224]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5155","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''do nematen aisi hain, jinkey barey mein bahut se log khasaray mein hain : sehat aur faraaghat.'' Bukhari."
"5156","Al-Mustawrid bin Shaddad (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: \By Allah! The example of this world in comparison to the Hereafter is just like one of you dipping his finger into the sea"
"5157","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk mry hwyy bkry kay pas say gzray js kay kan chhwtay thay، aap nay frmaya: tm myn say kwn yh psnd kray ga kh asay ayk drhm myn mlay؟ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya: hm asay ksy mamwly chyz kay lyay psnd nhyn kryn gay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \allh ky qsm! dnya allh kay nzdyk as (mrdh bkry) say bhy zyadh hqyr hay۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5158","Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \The world is a prison for the believer and a paradise for the disbeliever.\"" Narrated by Muslim."""
"5159","ans rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ ksy mwmn ky kwyy nyky zaya nhyn krta، asay as ka bdlh dnya myn dya jata hay awr aakhrt myn as ka bdlh dya jayay ga، awr kafr kw dnya myn as nyky kay bdlay rzq dya jata hay jb tk kh as nay nyky ky kwyy chyz yhan tk nh chhwry hw، jb tk kh as nay nyky nh ky hw، yhan tk kh allh taalyٰ nay as nyky kw chhwr dya hw۔ js ka asay anaam ml skta hay۔\ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5160","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jhnm kw khwahshat say dhanp dya gya hay awr jnt kw napsndydh chyzwn say dhanp dya gya hay۔ (bkhary، mslm)۔ albth shyh mslm myn lfz ((hjbt)) ky jgh ((hft)) hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5161","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”naqs dynar، drhm awr shal ka ghlam hay، agr asay dya jayay tw wh razy hwta hay awr agr asay nh dya jayay tw wh naraz hwta hay، wh brbad hwta hay awr agr as say zlyl nhyn hwta، tw wh zlyl hwta hay۔ as shkhs kw khwshkhbry hay js nay allh ky rah myn apnay ghwray ky lgam pkry hwyy hw، as kay bal bkhray hwyay hwn awr as kay paon khak aalwd hwn، agr wh hfazt pr mamwr hw tw wh apnay ahday pr qaym rhta hay، awr agr wh lshkr kay pychhay hay tw wh whan bhy sabt qdm rhta hay، agr as ky ajazt nh dy jayay tw as ky shfaat qbwl nhyn ky jayay gy۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5162","sydna abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay apnay bad tmharay lyay sb say zyadh js chyz ka khwf hay wh yh hay kh tmharay lyay dnya ky rwnqwn awr zynt kay drwazay khwl dyay jayyn gay۔ ayk aadmy nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! kya nyky as kay sath brayy layay gy؟ nby sly allh alyh wslm khamwsh rhay yhan tk kh hm nay yh smjha kh aap pr why nazl hw rhy hay۔ rawy khtay hyn kh phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay (chhrh mbark) say psynh pwnchha awr frmaya: sayl khan hay؟ gwya as ky taryf ky۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nyky apnay sath brayy nhyn laty، bay shk bhar ka mwsm sbzh agata hay، lykn as myn say kchh janwr kw mar dalta hay، phwl jata hay ya asay tbahy kay qryb phncha dyta hay، albth jw janwr hry ghas khata hay wh as wqt tk khata hay jb tk kh as ky kmr bhr nh jayay، phr wh dhwp ky trf mrta hay، phr dhwp ky trf mnh krta hay awr pychhay ht jata hay۔ jw shkhs asay apny zrwrt kay mtabq khayay awr as kay hq myn khrch kray tw wh as shkhs ky trh hay jw khata hay lykn kbhy syr nhyn hwta۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5163","amrw bn awf rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda ky qsm mjhay tm pr fqr ka andyshh nhyn hay، lykn mjhay dr hay kh tm pr dnya asy trh phyl jayay js trh tm say phlay lwgwn kay lyay phylayy gyy thy، phr tm as kay lyay as trh mqablh krw gay js trh anhwn nay as kay lyay mqablh kya tha، awr wh tmhyn tbah kr day ga jysa kh as nay tbah kya۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5164","It is narrated from Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) supplicated: \O Allah! Provide for the family of Muhammad (peace and blessings be upon him) only as much sustenance as will suffice to maintain the bond between their bodies and souls.\"" Agreed upon. In another narration it is stated: \""As much as is sufficient for subsistence\"" (grant livelihood enough for subsistence)."""
"5165","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh shkhs kamyab hwa js nay (apnay rb ky) ataat ky، asay as ky zrwrt kay lyay kafy rzq dya gya awr allh nay asay jw kchh dya as pr razy rha۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5166","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” bndh khta hay myra mal، myra mal، halankh as ka mal srf tyn trh say hwta hay: jw as nay khaya awr khtm kya، ya prana awr prana، ya (allh ky rah myn) dya awr zkhyrh kya، awr jw kchh as kay pychhay hay wh an lwgwn kay lyay chhwray ga۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5167","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myt kay sath tyn chyzyn aaty hyn، an myn say dw lwt jaty hyn awr ayk as kay sath rhty hay، as ka ahl w ayal، as ka mal awr as ka aml as kay sath jata hay، as ka ahl w ayal awr as ka mal waps aata hay، awr as ka aml as kay sath rhta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5168","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say kwn hay jw apnay warswn kay mal kw apnay mal pr trjyh dyta hay؟ shabh nay jwab dya: hm myn say hr ayk apnay mal kw apnay warswn kay mal pr trjyh dyta hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bay shk as ka mal why hay jw as nay aagay bhyja hay awr jw mal as nay pychhay chhwra hay wh as kay warswn kay lyay hay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5169","mtrf apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn nay apnay aap kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay as wqt pysh kya jb aap swrh altkaswr ky tlawt kr rhay thay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: abn aadm khta hay: myra mal، myra mal۔ aay abn aadm! tmhara mal srf why hay jw tm nay khaya awr khaya، ya prana awr prana، ya sdqh kya awr (aakhrt kay lyay) aagay bhyja\۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5170","Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Wealth is not in the abundance of possessions and goods"
"5171","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwn hay jw mjh say yh klmat sykhay awr an pr aml kray ya ksy kw skhayay jw an pr aml kray؟ myn nay kha: ya rswl allh! myn krwn ga۔ tw as nay myra hath pkr kr panch chyzyn gnyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \hram chyzwn say bchw، tm lwgwn myn sb say zyadh abadt gzar bn jao gay، allh nay tmharay lyay jw kchh lkh dya hay as pr razy rhw، awr tm lwgwn myn sb say zyadh amyr bn jao gay، apnay prwsy kay sath achha slwk krw، tw mwmn hw ga، lwgwn say why mhbt krw jw tm apnay lyay psnd krtay hw، awr tm hnsy say zyadh mslman nhyn hw gay۔\"" dl\"" ahmd، trmzy awr amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5172","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ frmata hay: aay abn aadm! apny abadt kay lyay apnay aap kw aazad kr، myn tyray dl kw qnaat say bhr dwn ga awr tyry ghrbt dwr kr dwn ga، lykn agr tw nay aysa nh kya tw myn tjhay kam myn mshghwl rkhwn ga awr tyry fqr kw dwr nhyn krwn ga۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5173","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay ayk aadmy ky abadt awr shdyd aqydt ka zkr kya gya awr dwsray aadmy ky tqwyٰ awr ahtyat ka bhy zkr kya gya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” (abadt awr kwshsh) kw tqwyٰ say tshbyh nh dw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5174","amrw bn mymwn alawdy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kw nsyht krtay hwyay frmaya: ”panch chyzwn kw panch say phlay faydh atha lw: apny jwany kw brhapay say phlay، apny sht kw apny bymary say phlay، apny dwlt kw apny ghrbt say phlay، apny fraght kw apny mshghwlyt say phlay awr apny zndgy kw apny mwt say phlay۔ amam trmzy nay asay mrsl hdys qrar dya hay۔ hsn، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5175","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya tm myn say kwyy bay thasha mal ka antzar krta hay، ya ghrbt jw asay (taat w abadt kw) bhla dyty hay، ya aysy bymary jw brbad kr dyty hay، ya brhapa jw bay hwdh batwn ka antzar krta hay، ya djal kay lyay۔ pwshydh aazmaysh ya qyamt ka antzar kya ja rha hay، awr qyamt sb say bry aaft awr sb say tlkh chyz hay۔\ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5176","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dykhw، dnya awr jw kchh as myn hay sb mlawn hyn، swayay allh kay zkr kay، allh kay nzdyk psndydh aml، awr aalm awr mtalm kay۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5177","Sahl bin Sa’d (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: “If the world (in importance) was worth even the wing of a mosquito in the sight of Allah, He would not have given a disbeliever even a sip of water from it.” Its chain is weak. Narrated by Ahmad, al-Tirmidhi, and Ibn Majah."
"5178","Ibn Mas'ud (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Do not establish estates"
"5179","abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay dnya kw trjyh dy as nay aakhrt kw nqsan phnchaya awr js nay aakhrt kw trjyh dy as nay apny dnya kw nqsan phnchaya، lhza hmyshh rhnay waly chyz kw fna hwnay pr trjyh dw“۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5180","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap nay frmaya: ”drhm awr dynar ka ghlam mlawn hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5181","kab bn malk rzy allh anh apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bkrywn kay rywr myn rh janay walay dw bhwkay bhyryay anhyn atna nqsan nhyn phnchatay jtna mal w dwlt ky hrs as kay dyn kw phnchaty hay۔ hsn، asay trmzy awr aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5182","Khabbab (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates from the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Whatever a believer spends"
"5183","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” allh ky rah myn khrch krnay ka swab hay swayay tamyr kay، as myn khrch krnay myn kwyy bhlayy nhyn۔ (trmzy) awr anhwn nay kha kh yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5184","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk dn bahr tshryf layay awr hm aap kay sath thay۔ as nay ayk awncha gnbd dykha awr kha: yh kya hay؟ as kay sathywn nay jwab dya kh yh ayk ansary aadmy ka hay۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm khamwsh rhay awr asay apnay dl myn rkha yhan tk kh as kay malk nay aakr lwgwn kay samnay aap kw slam kya lykn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay as say mnh phyr lya۔ as nay kyy bar aysa kya yhan tk kh as shkhs nay nby sly allh alyh wslm ky narazgy awr an say byzary kw phchan lya۔ as nay apnay sathywn say wjh pwchhy awr kha kh allh ky qsm mjhay lgta hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mjh say naraz hyn lykn wjh mjhay nhyn malwm۔ anhwn nay as say kha kh tm bahr aayay awr apna gnbd dykha۔ wh shkhs apnay gnbd kay pas gya، asay gra dya awr asay zmyn say brabr kr dya۔ phr ayk dn rswl allh (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) bahr tshryf layay awr gnbd kw nhyn dykha۔ pwchha gnbd kw kya hwa؟ shabh nay arz kya kh as kay malk nay hm say aap ky jdayy ka sbb pwchha tw hm nay asay btaya tw as nay asay gra dya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw، hr wh amart jw zrwry nhyn wh apnay malk kay lyay bwjh hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5185","abw hashm bn atbh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay nsyht frmayy: ”tmharay lyay srf atna mal jma krna kafy hay kh tmharay pas allh ky rah myn jhad krnay kay lyay ayk bndh awr ayk swar hw۔ ahmd، trmzy، nsayy، abn majh awr mshkw kay baz nskhwn myn asay abw hashm bn atbd yany tao kay bjayay dal kay sath zkr kya gya hay awr yh ktaby ghlty hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay ahmd، trmzy، nsayy، abn majh awr mshkw alsn nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5186","sydna asman rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy kw an tyn chyzwn kay swa ksy chyz ka hq nhyn: rhaysh ka mkan، as ky brhngy kw dhanpnay kay lyay lbas، awr rwty awr pany۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5187","shl bn sad rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy aaya awr khnay lga ya rswl allh mjhay kwyy aysa aml btayyay jsay myn krwn tw allh awr lwg mjh say mhbt kryn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: dnya kw chhwr dw allh tm say mhbt kray ga awr jw kchh lwgwn kay pas hay asay chhwr dw lwg tm say mhbt kryn gay۔ kmzwr asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5188","sydna abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk chtayy pr swyay، jb aap athay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm kay jsm mbark pr as (chtayy) kay nshanat thay۔ abn msawd rzy allh anh nay arz kya ya rswl allh agr aap hmyn hkm dyn tw hm aap kay lyay nrm bstr tyar kr dyn gay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay dnya say kya lyna dyna، myn awr dnya as swar ky trh hyn jw drkht kay sayay myn rkta hay، phr chla jata hay awr asay pychhay chhwr dyta hay۔ hsn، asay ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5189","abwamamh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray dwstwn myn sb say zyadh qabl rshk wh mwmn hay js kay pas dnya ka bht km mal hw، nmaz myn lzt hw، apnay rb ky khwb abadt krta hw، khlwt myn bhy as ky ataat krta hw، lwgwn kay drmyan marwf nhyn hwta، as ky trf angly athanay wala، kfayt shaary awr kfayt shaary ka haml nhyn hwta۔ as pr sbr hay۔\ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apny anglyan phyr lyn awr frmaya: ”as ky mwt jldy aaty hay، as kay swgwar km hyn awr as ky myras km hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5190","abwamamh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray rb nay mjhay mkh ky wady bth (ya mkh ky knkrywn) kw swnay myn bdlnay ky pyshksh ky، myn nay arz kya: aay myray rb! nhyn، blkh myn yh chahta hwn kh ayk dn syr hw jaon awr dwsray dn bhwka rhwn، jb myn tjhay yad krwn awr dwsray dn bhwka rhwn۔ myn syr hw gya، myn tyry hmd krta hwn awr tyra shkr ada krta hwn۔‘‘ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5191","abydallh bn mhsn rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm myn say jw shkhs sbh athay wh apnay ahl w ayal kay baray myn mhfwz، apnay jsm myn tndrst awr ayk dn ky khwrak rkhta hw tw gwya tmam dnya as kay lyay charwn trf say jma hw gyy hay۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5192","mqdam bn madykrb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”kwyy aadmy apnay pyt say zyadh bra brtn nhyn bhrta، aadmy kay lyay pyth sydhy rkhnay kay lyay chnd mnh khana kafy hay، lykn agr wh (zyadh khayay) tw ayk thayy (apnay pyt ka) ayk thayy khanay kay lyay، ayk thayy pynay kay lyay۔ shyh، asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5193","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kw dkartay hwyay sna tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apny dkar km krw، kywnkh jw shkhs dnya myn pyt bhr kr khayay ga wh qyamt kay dn lwgwn myn bht bhwka rhay ga۔ shrh alsn، awr amam trmzy nay asay asy trh rwayt kya hay۔ zayf، shrh alsnn awr trmzy myn rwayt hay۔"
"5194","Ka'b bin 'Iyad (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: \Every nation has had a trial (test and tribulation)"
"5195","Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates from the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him), he said: \On the Day of Resurrection"
"5196","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn bnday say sb say phla swal jw namtwn kay baray myn pwchha jayay ga wh yh hwga kh kya hm nay tyray jsm kw tndrst nhyn bnaya awr thnday pany say tyry pyas nhyn bjhayy؟ as ka slslh shyh hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5197","abn msawd rzy allh anh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn bnday kay paon as wqt tk nhyn hlyn gay jb tk kh as say panch chyzwn kay baray myn swal nh kya jayay: as ky zndgy kay baray myn kh as nay asay kysay gzara، apny jwany kay baray myn، as nay khan khrch kya، as nay ktna mal khrch kya، awr as nay ktna aml kya awr khan khrch kya۔ as kay pas alm tha۔\ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5198","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: ”tm srkh chmray walay awr kalay chmray walay say bhtr nhyn hw، swayay as kay kh tm prhyzgary say as pr sbqt lay jao“۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5199","abwzr rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb bndh dnya say bay nyazy akhtyar kr lyta hay tw allh taalyٰ as kay dl myn hkmt pyda kr dyta hay، asay as ky zban say nkal dyta hay، asay dnya kay aywb، as ky bymarywn awr as kay aybwn say mhfwz rkhnay ky twfyq ata frmata hay۔ (jnt)۔\ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5200","It is narrated from Abu Dharr (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Successful is the one whose heart Allah has made pure for faith"
"5201","aqbh bn aamr rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm allh taalyٰ kw dykhtay hw kh wh ksy bnday kw as ky nafrmany (nafrmany) kay bawjwd dnya day rha hay jsay wh psnd nhyn krta، tw yh (allh ky trf say) tdbyr hay۔ phr rswl allh (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy: ps jb wh as bat kw bhwl gyay js say anhyn nsyht ky gyy thy tw hm nay an pr hr chyz kay drwazay khwl dyay، yhan tk kh jb wh as pr khwsh hwyay jw anhyn dya gya tw hm nay anhyn achank pkr lya، phr wh tbahy awr maywsy myn dwb gyay۔ hsn، ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5202","abwamamh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ahl sfah myn say ayk shkhs ka antqal hwa awr as nay ayk dynar chhwra tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: (yh dynar) nshany hay۔ rawy byan krta hay kh phr ayk awr aadmy ka antqal hwa awr as nay dw dynar chhwray، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: (yh dw dynar) dw nshanyan hyn۔ shyh، jsay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5203","maawyh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh wh apnay mamwn abw hashm bn atbh rzy allh anh ky ayadt kay lyay gyay tw abw hashm rzy allh anh rwnay lgay۔ as nay pwchha، \chcha jan! aap kw rwnay ky kya chyz hay؟ kya yh kwyy tklyf hay jw aap kw pryshan kr rhy hay، ya yh dnya ka lalch hay؟\"" as nay jwab dya kh hrgz nhyn، blkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn nsyht frmayy thy lykn myn nay as pr aml nhyn kya۔ as nay pwchha wh (nsyht) kya thy؟ anhwn nay kha kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: tmharay lyay srf atna mal jma krna kafy hay kh tmharay pas allh ky rah myn jhad krnay kay lyay ayk khadm awr swar hw۔ awr myra khyal hay kh myn nay (as say zyadh dwlt) jma kr ly hay۔\"" zayf، asay ahmd، trmzy، alnsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5204","am aldrdaa rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myn nay abw drdaa rzy allh anh say kha: tm flan ky trh mal w dwlt ky tlash kywn nhyn krtay؟ as nay jwab dya: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: tm say aagay ayk dshwar gzar rasth hay jsay bhary bwjh athanay walay abwr nhyn kr skyn gay۔ myn as pas say gzrnay kay lyay apna bwjh hlka rkhna chahta hwn۔ as ky snd zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5205","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya kwyy aysa hay jw pany pr chlta hw lykn as kay paon gylay nh hwn؟ anhwn nay arz kya ya rswl allh! nhyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: dnya dar aysa hay kh wh gnahwn say mhfwz nhyn rh skta۔ an dwnwn ahadys kw amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5206","jbyr bn nfyr rzy allh anh mrsl ky rwayt myn byan krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjh pr yh why nhyn aayy kh myn mal jma krwn awr tajrwn myn say hw jaon، blkh mjh pr why ky gyy hay kh: apnay rb ky tsbyh krw، yhan tk kh tm apnay rb ky hmd w sna kay sath sjdh krnay walwn myn say hw، jb tk kh tm apnay rb ky hmd w sna kay sath sjdh ryz hw۔ shrh alsn awr abw naym nay hlyh myn abw mslm say rwayt ky hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ shrh alsn awr hly alawlyaa myn rwayt hay۔"
"5207","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay dnya kw hlal tryqay say tlb kya، mangnay say bchnay، apnay ahl w ayal pr khrch krnay awr apnay prwsy kay sath hsn slwk krnay kay lyay، tw wh qyamt kay dn allh taalyٰ say as trh mlay ga kh as ka chhrh chwdhwyn ky rat myn chmkta hw awr hr ayk aadmy kw dnya ky char chandny ky trh chmkta hw ga۔ apnay mal myn azafh kray، dwsrwn pr fkhr kray، awr dkhaway kay lyay، tw allh taalyٰ say as hal myn mlay ga kh wh as say naraz hwga۔\ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5208","sydna shl bn sad rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk khyr kay khzanay hyn awr an khzanwn ky knjyan bhy hyn، khwshkhbry hay as bnday kay lyay js kw allh taalyٰ nay nyky ky knjy bna dy، awr bnday kay lyay brayy kw bnd kr dya awr bnday kay lyay bdy kw bnd kr dya۔ nyky kay lyay ayk tala۔\ as ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5209","Ali (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) said: \When there is no blessing placed in a servant's wealth"
"5210","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tamyr kay kamwn myn hram say bchw، kywnkh yh tbahy ky bnyad hay۔ dwnwn rwaytwn kw amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5211","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dnya as ka ghr hay js ka kwyy ghr nhyn، as ka mal as ka hay js kay pas kwyy mal nhyn، awr asay srf why jma krta hay jw aqlmnd nhyn hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5212","hzyfh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw khtbh dytay hwyay sna: ”shrab tmam gnahwn ka mjmwah hay، awrtyn shytan kay phnday hyn، awr dnya ky mhbt hr gnah ky jr awr bnyad hay۔ rawy khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”awrtwn kw as trh pychhay rkhw js trh allh nay anhyn pychhay rkha hay۔ mjhay yh nhyn mla۔ rzyn nay byan kya۔"
"5213","awr amam byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn hsn snd kay sath mrsl qrar dya hay: dnya ky mhbt tmam gnahwn ky jr hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5214","Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \What I fear most for my Ummah is the desires of the self and prolonged hopes"
"5215","It is narrated from Ali (may Allah be pleased with him), he said: The world is passing away while the Hereafter is coming, and each of them has seekers. You should be seekers of the Hereafter and not seekers of the world, because today is the time for action and not for reckoning, while tomorrow will be for reckoning and not for action. Narrated by al-Bukhari."
"5216","It is narrated from Amr (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) delivered a sermon one day, and in his sermon he said: \Listen! The world is a present wealth; both the righteous and the wicked eat from it. Listen! The Hereafter is an inevitable reality; at that time"
"5217","shdad rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \aay lwgw! bay shk dnya mal hay، hr nyk awr bdkar as myn say khata hay، aakhrt ayk yqyny hqyqt awr scha wadh hay، as dn ansaf krnay wala، qadr mtlq badshah fyslh kray ga، wh yhan hq kay mtlashywn kw qaym nhyn kray ga، whan pr batl kay mtlashy nhyn hwn gay۔\"" dnya kay mtlashy hr bchh apny man ky pyrwy krta hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abw naym nay hly alawlyaa myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5218","abw drdaa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb swrj tlwa hwta hay tw as kay dwnwn knarwn say dw frshtay pkartay hyn، jnwn awr ansanwn kay alawh tmam mkhlwqat kw an ky aawazyn snayy dyty hyn: aay lwgw، apnay rb ky trf aao، wh (mal) jw bht km hay، lykn as say bht bhtr hay، lykn as say bht bhtr hay۔ allh ka)۔\ dwnwn ahadys kw abw naym nay hlyh myn rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abw naym nay hly alawlyaa myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5219","Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates in a marfu‘ (attributed to the Prophet) tradition: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) said: \When a person dies"
"5220","It is narrated from Imam Malik (may Allah have mercy on him) that Luqman said to his son: \My son! Indeed"
"5221","Abdullah bin Amr (may Allah be pleased with him) reports: It was asked to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him), \Which person is the best?\"" He (peace and blessings be upon him) replied: \""Every person with a pure heart and a truthful tongue.\"" The companions said"
"5222","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”char chyzyn aysy hyn، agr wh tm myn payy jayyn tw chahay tmhyn dnya nh bhy mlay، kwyy nqsan ya kmy nhyn: amant ky hfazt، bat myn schayy، hsn akhlaq، awr hram khanay say prhyz krna۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5223","amam malk say rwayt hay، anhwn nay kha: mjhay yh hdys mly hay kh lqman hkym say pwchha gya kh tm kn chyzwn say as mqam pr phnchay js myn hm tmhyn dykhtay hyn؟ aap nay frmaya: schayy، amantyn pwry krna، awr fzwl chyzwn kw chhwrna۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay malk nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5224","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aamal (allh kay hzwr shfaat kay lyay) aayyn gay، daa aayay gy awr khay gy kh aay rb myn nmaz hwn“۔ wh khay ga kh tw nyky pr hay۔ sdqh aayay ga awr khay ga kh aay rb! myn sdqh hwn۔' wh khay ga kh tw nyky pr hay۔ phr rwzh dar aayay ga awr khay ga kh aay rb! myn rwzay say hwn۔' wh khay ga kh tw nyky pr hay۔ phr asy trh aamal aatay rhyn gay awr allh taalyٰ frmata rhay ga kh tm nyky pr hw۔ phr aslam aayay ga awr khay ga kh aay rb! tm amn hw awr myn aslam hwn۔' allh taalyٰ frmayay ga kh tw nyky pr hay۔ aaj tyry wjh say hsab mangwn ga awr tyry wjh say ata krwn ga۔ allh taalyٰ nay apny ktab myn frmaya hay kh jw shkhs aslam kay alawh kwyy awr dyn tlash kray ga wh as say hrgz qbwl nhyn kya jayay ga awr wh aakhrt myn nqsan athanay walwn myn say hwga۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay\""5225"""
"5225","Hazrat Aisha (ra) se riwayat hai ke unhone farmaya: Hamare paas ek parda tha jis par parindon ki tasweerein bani hui theen. Toh Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: ""Ya Aisha! Isay badal do, kyunki main jab isay dekhta hoon toh mujhe dunya yaad aa jati hai."""
"5226","hzrt abw aywb ansary rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha kh mjhay ayk mkhtsr nsyht frmayyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jb tm nmaz prhw tw as trh daa krw kh gwya yh tmhary alwdaay nmaz hay، kwyy aysy bat nh khw js kay lyay tmhyn kl maafy mangny pray، awr lwgwn kay pas jw kchh hay as say balkl naamyd awr latalq rhw۔\"" zayf، asay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5227","Mu’az bin Jabal (Razi Allah Anhu) riwayat karte hain: Jab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne unhen Yemen bheja to Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) unhein nasihaat karne ke liye un ke saath nikle. Us waqt Mu'az (Razi Allah Anhu) sawaar the aur Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) unki sawari ke saath paidal chal rahe the. Jab Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne khatam kiya to farmaya: \Aye Mu'az"
"5228","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy: ”allh taalyٰ as kay synh kw khwl dyta hay jsay wh aslam ky trf hdayt dyna chahta hay۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb nwr synh myn dakhl hwta hay tw synh khl jata hay۔ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! kya kwyy aysy alamt hay js say asay phchana ja skay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han، dhwkay kay ghr (dnya) say dwry akhtyar krna، abdy ghr (aakhrt) ky trf mtwjh hwna، awr mwt aanay say phlay mwt ky tyary krna۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5229","sydna abwhryrh awr abw khlad rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm ksy aysay bnday kw dykhw jsay dnya say bay nyaz kya gya hw awr wh km alfaz wala hw tw as ky shbt tlash krw، kywnkh asay hkmt dy gyy hay۔ dwnwn rwaytwn kw amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ zayf jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5230","abwhryrh awr abwkhlad ؓ say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya :’’ jb tm bnday kw dykhw kh asay dnya say bay rghbty ata ky gyy hay awr wh km gw hay tw as ka qrb hasl krw kywnkh asay hkmt ata ky gyy hay ۔‘‘ dwnwn rwaytyn amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql ky hyn ۔ zayf ، rwah albyhqy fy shab alayman ۔"
"5231","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bht say pragndh balwn walay، drwazay say phyray hwyay hyn، agr wh allh ky qsm khayay tw allh taalyٰ as ky qsm pwry kr dyta hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5232","msab bn sad byan krtay hyn kh sad rzy allh anh ka khyal tha kh wh an lwgwn pr fzylt awr fzylt rkhtay hyn jw an say km drjh kay thay (skhawt myn)۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmhary mdd awr rzq srf tmharay kmzwrwn ky wjh say dya jata hay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5233","asamh bn zyd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”maraj ky rat myn jnt kay drwazay pr khra hwa tw dykha kh as myn dakhl hwnay walwn myn say aksr ghryb thay، jb kh maldar rwkay hwyay thay، awr ahl jhnm (yany kafrwn kw) rwkay hwyay thay، awr myn nay dykha kh myn nay jnt kay drwazay pr khray hw kr (kafrwn ka hkm dya)۔ kh as myn dakhl hwnay walwn ky aksryt khwatyn ky thy۔\ pr atfaq hwa۔"""
"5234","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn nay jnt myn jhanka tw dykha kh as kay bashndwn ky aksryt ghrybwn ky thy awr myn nay jhnm myn jhanka tw dykha kh as kay bashndwn ky aksryt awrtwn ky hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5235","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” mhajryn myn say ghryb lwg qyamt kay dn maldarwn say chalys sal phlay jnt myn dakhl hwn gay“۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5236","shl bn sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas say gzra، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay sath bythay hwyay ayk shkhs say frmaya: ”as shkhs kay baray myn tmhary kya rayay hay؟ as nay jwab dya: \wh mazz lwgwn myn say hay، allh ky qsm wh aysa hay kh agr wh khyn bhy shady ky pyshksh kray tw as ky shady kr dy jayay، awr agr wh sfarsh kray tw as ky shfaat qbwl ky jayay۔\"" rawy khtay hyn: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm khamwsh rhay۔ phr ayk awr aadmy whan say gzra tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as shkhs kay baray myn tmhara kya khyal hay؟ as nay jwab dya: ya rswl allh! wh ghryb mslmanwn myn say hay، wh aysa hay kh agr khyn nkah ka mshwrh day tw as ky shady nh ky jayay، awr agr wh sfarsh kray tw as ky shfaat qbwl nh ky jayay، awr agr bat kray tw as ky bat nh sny jayay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh (akyla) aadmy as pwry zmyn say bhtr hay jysay phlay aadmy say bhra hwa hw۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""
"5237","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kay ghr walwn nay mslsl dw dn tk jw ky rwty pyt bhr kr nhyn khayy yhan tk kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky wfat hw gyy۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5238","sayd mqbry rhm allh alyh abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt krtay hyn kh wh kchh lwgwn kay pas say gzray jn kay samnay ayk bhny hwyy bkry thy۔ anhwn nay aap kw (khanay ky) dawt dy، lykn aap nay asay khanay say ankar kr dya awr kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm as dnya say tshryf lay gyay awr aap nay kbhy jw ky rwty pyt bhr kr nhyn khayy۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5239","Anas (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhone Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ke liye jau ki roti aur badrang (be-kar) charbi layi, jab ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ki zirah (kabootar) Madinah mein aik yahoodi ke paas girwi rakhi hui thi. Unhone unse apne ghar walon ke liye jau liya tha. Aur maine Anas (Razi Allah Anhu) ko kehte suna: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ke ghar mein shaam ke waqt na to aik sa' gehu tha aur na hi koi aur ghalla, halanke Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ke naw paak biwiyan (Ummahat ul Momineen) theen. Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"5240","amr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa، aap khjwr kay ptwn say bny chtayy pr lytay hwyay thay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay nh kwyy bstr bchha rkha tha awr nh kwyy awr chyz۔ as ky trf chtayy kay nshanat dkhayy day rhay thay awr wh khjwr kay drkht kay ptwn say bhray chmray kay tkyay say tyk lgayay hwyay thay۔ myn nay kha: ya rswl allh! allh say daa kryn kh wh aap ky amt kw ksrt say nwazay، kywnkh fars awr rwmywn pr bht zyadh ahsan kya gya hay، halankh wh allh ky abadt nhyn krtay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \aay abn khtab! kya tm abhy tk asy mqam pr hw؟ yh (kafr) wh lwg hyn jn kay lyay dnya ky zndgy myn lztyn jldy kr dy gyy hyn۔\"" ayk awr rwayt myn hay kh kya tm as bat pr razy nhyn kh an kay lyay dnya hay awr hmaray lyay aakhrt hay؟ pr atfaq hwa۔"""
"5241","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay sfah kay str shabh say mlaqat ky، an myn say ksy kay pas bhy bry chadr nhyn thy۔ an myn say hr ayk kay pas ya tw nchla lbas tha ya ayk hy chadr، awr anhwn nay as ka knarh apnay glay myn bandh rkha tha۔ an myn say kchh chadryn an ky pndlywn kay aadhay hsay tk phnch jaty thyn awr kchh an kay tkhnwn tk phnch jaty thyn awr wh asay apnay hathwn say jma krtay thay takh an ky shrmgahyn khly nh rh jayyn۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5242","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy ksy aysay shkhs kw dykhay jw as say mal awr shkl w swrt myn as say brtr hay tw asay chahyay kh as shkhs kw dykhay jw as say kmtr hay۔ awr mslm ky rwayt myn hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: (dnywy maamlat myn) apnay say nychay walay kw dykhw awr apnay say awpr walay ky trf mt dykhw، kywnkh yh zyadh mnasb hay takh tm allh ky namtwn kw hqyr nh smjhw jw as nay tmhyn ata ky hyn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5243","Abu Huraira (Razi Allah Anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Gareeb log ameer logon se paanch sau saal pehle Jannat mein daakhil honge"
"5244","sydna ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aay allh! mjhay mskyn ky halt myn zndh rkh، mjhay mskyn ky halt myn mwt day، awr mjhay mskynwn kay grwh myn jma frma۔ aayshh rzy allh anha nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! kywn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \kywnkh wh maldarwn say chalys sal phlay jnt myn dakhl hwn gay۔ aayshh! ksy ghryb kw khaly hath nh phyrw، khwah wh khjwr kay ayk tkray say hy kywn nh hw۔ aayshh! ghrybwn say mhbt krw، anhyn apnay qryb rkhw، takh qyamt kay dn allh tmhyn apnay qryb rkhay۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5245","awr abn majh nay abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt kya kh \ghrybwn kay grwh myn athayay jayyn\""۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5246","abw drdaa rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjhay apnay kmzwrwn myn tlash krw، kywnkh tmhyn srf tmharay kmzwrwn ky wjh say rzq awr mdd dy jaty hay۔ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5247","amyh bn khald bn abdallh bn asyd nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap ghryb mhajryn ky daaon say fth hasl krtay thay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay shrh alsn myn rwayt kya gya hay۔"
"5248","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bdkar shkhs say as ky namtwn pr hsd nh krw، kywnkh tm nhyn jantay kh as kay mrnay kay bad as pr kya gzray gy، allh kay han as kay lyay ayk aysy hlakt hay jw kbhy nhyn mray gy۔ yany: jhnm۔ as ky snd zayf hay jw shrh alsn myn mnqwl hay۔"
"5249","Abdullah bin Umar narrates that the Messenger of Allah said: \The world is a prison and a famine for the believer; when he departs from the world"
"5250","qtadh bn naman rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ ksy bnday say mhbt krta hay tw asay dnya ky (mal w hysyt) say as trh bchata hay js trh tm myn say kwyy apnay bymar kw pany say bchata hay۔ shyh، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5251","mhmwd bn lbyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dw chyzyn ansan kw napsnd hyn: ansan mwt kw napsnd krta hay، halankh mwt mwmn kay lyay ftnay say bhtr hay، awr wh mal ky tngy kw napsnd krta hay، jb kh thwray mal ka hsab hlka hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5252","abdallh bn mghfl rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa awr arz kya kh myn aap say mhbt krta hwn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya dykhw tm kya khh rhay hw۔ as nay kha allh ky qsm myn tm say mhbt krta hwn۔ yh bat anhwn nay tyn bar khy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh agr tm schay hw tw ghrbt say nmtnay kay lyay dhal tyar krw، kywnkh ghrbt as kay lyay aaty hay jw mjh say mhbt krta hay sylab say bhy zyadh tyz۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5253","sydna ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ky rah myn kwyy atna nhyn draya gya jtna mjhay draya gya hay awr ksy kw allh ky rah myn atny tklyf nhyn phnchy jtny mjhay ayza phnchayy gyy hay، tys dn awr ratyn aysy gzry hyn kh mjh pr allh taalyٰ ky kwyy aysy halt nhyn thy kh allh taalyٰ as say razy hw“۔ hmyn khanay kay lyay jw kwyy jandar kha skta hay swayay as thwry mqdar kay jsay blal rzy allh anh apny bghl myn chhpa sktay thay۔ awr amam trmzy rhmh allh khtay hyn: as hdys ka mfhwm yh hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mkh say frar hwyay tw blal rzy allh anh aap kay sath thay، awr blal rzy allh anh kay pas atna hy khana tha jtna wh apny bghl myn rkh sktay thay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5254","tlhh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say bhwk ky shkayt ky tw hm nay apnay pyt say apnay kpray athayay takh as pr bndha hwa pthr dkhaya jayay۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn apnay pyt myn bndhay hwyay dw pthr dkhayay۔ __REF_N__ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5255","Abu Huraira (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh bhookhe ho gaye, to Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne unhein ek ek kar ke khajoor di. Is ki sanad sahih hai; Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"5256","amrw bn shayb apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: dw khsltyn hyn، js myn yh hwn، allh taalyٰ asay shkr gzar awr sbr krnay wala lkhta hay، jw shkhs dyn kay maamlay myn apnay awpr ksy ky trf dykhta hay awr as ky pyrwy krta hay، awr ksy kw dnya myn allh ka shkr ada krta hay awr ksy kw nychay ky trf dykhta hay۔ as pr allh taalyٰ asay shkr gzar awr sbr krnay wala lkhta hay awr jw shkhs dyn kay maamlay myn apnay say nychay ky trf dykhta hay awr dnya kay maamlat myn apnay awpr ksy kw dykhta hay awr jw asay nhyn mla as pr ghmgyn hwta hay tw allh asay shkr gzar awr sbr krnay wala nhyn lkhta۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔ awr abw sayd say rwayt ky gyy hdys: \khwshy krw، mhajryn kay ghryb grwh\""، qraan kay fzayl kay bab kay bad zkr kya gya hay۔"""
"5257","abwabdalrhmn hbly khtay hyn kh myn nay abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anh kw khtay sna، ayk aadmy nay an say pwchha: kya hm ghryb mhajryn myn say nhyn hyn؟ abdallh rzy allh anh nay as say kha: kya tmhary kwyy bywy hay js kay sath tm rat gzartay hw؟ as nay kha: han! as nay kha: kya tmharay pas rhnay kay lyay mkan hay؟ as nay kha: han! as nay kha: tw phr tw maldarwn myn say hay۔ as nay kha: myra ayk nwkr bhy hay۔ as nay kha: phr tm badshah hw۔ abdalrhmn nay kha: abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anh kay pas tyn aadmy aayay، myn as wqt an kay sath tha۔ anhwn nay kha: abw mhmd! allh ky qsm! hmaray pas kchh bhy nhyn، kwyy khrchh، kwyy swary awr kwyy saman nhyn۔ as nay an say kha: tm kya chahtay hw؟ agr tm chahw tw hmaray pas aao، awr allh nay jw kchh hmyn mhya kya hay، hm tmhyn dyn gay۔ awr agr aap chahyn tw hm aap ka maamlh badshah say byan kr sktay hyn۔ awr agr tm chahw tw sbr krw kywnkh myn nay rswl allh (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) kw yh frmatay hwyay sna : ghryb mhajryn qyamt kay dn maldarwn say chalys sal phlay jnt myn dakhl hwn gay ۔ anhwn nay kha: hm sbr kryn gay awr kchh nhyn mangyn gay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5258","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn msjd myn bytha hwa tha kh ghryb mhajryn ky ayk jmaat bhy hlqh bna kr jma thy۔ jb aap sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay tw aap an kay hlqh myn shaml hw gyay awr myn bhy ath kr an ky trf chla gya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghryb mhajryn kw as chyz ky bshart dw js say an kay chhrwn pr khwshy aayay gy، kywnkh wh maldarwn say chalys sal phlay jnt myn dakhl hwn gay۔ rawy khtay hyn: myn nay dykha kh an kay chhray chmknay lgay، awr abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma nay byan kya: yhan tk kh myn nay chaha kh myn an kay sath hwta ya an myn hwta۔ shyh، aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5259","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myray pyaray nby sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay sat chyzwn ka hkm dya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay ghrybwn say mhbt krnay awr an kay qryb rhnay ka hkm dya۔ as nay mjhay hkm dya kh (dnywy maamlat myn) mjh say nychay walwn ky trf dykhwn awr mjh say awpr walwn ky trf nh dykhwn۔ as nay mjhay hkm dya kh myn rshth darywn kw brqrar rkhwn khwah wh mjhay kat dyn۔ as nay mjhay hkm dya kh ksy say kchh nh mangw۔ as nay mjhay sch bwlnay ka hkm dya khwah wh krwa hw۔ as nay mjhay hkm dya kh allh (hq) kay baray myn ksy mlamt krnay walay ky mlamt say nh drw۔ awr mjhay hkm dya kh myn (la hwl w la qw ala ballh) ksrt say prha krw، kywnkh yh klmat arsh kay nychay khzanwn myn say hyn۔ ‘‘ as ka slslh hsn hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5260","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw dnya ky tyn chyzyn psnd thyn: khana، awrt awr khwshbw۔ an myn say dw asay ata kyay gyay awr ayk nhyn dya gya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm kw awrtyn (pakyzh azwaj mthrat rzy allh anha) awr atr ata kyay gyay، lykn aap kw (atmynan bkhsh) khana nhyn dya gya۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5261","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray lyay khwshbw awr awrtyn mhbwb bnayy gyy hyn awr myry aankhwn ky thndk nmaz myn hay۔ ahmd، nsayy awr abn jwzy nay ((mn aldnya)) kay bad ((hbybh alyh)) kay azafay kw rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5262","sydna maaz bn jbl rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ymn bhyja tw frmaya: aysh w ashrt ky zndgy bsr krnay say bchw، kywnkh allh kay (mkhls) bnday aysh w ashrt myn rhnay walay nhyn hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5263","aly rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh taalyٰ kay thwray say rzq pr razy hw jata hay، allh taalyٰ as kay thwray say aml pr razy hw jata hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5264","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs bhwka hw ya ksy chyz ka mhtaj hw awr asay lwgwn say chhpayay tw allh taalyٰ pr yh hq hay kh wh asay ayk sal tk hlal rzq ata kray۔ dwnwn rwaytwn kw amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ as ky rwayt ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5265","amran bn hsyn rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ apnay as mwmn bnday say mhbt krta hay jw mhtaj hw awr mhtaj hwnay kay bawjwd (dwsrwn say) swal nh kray۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5266","zyd bn aslm rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk dn amr rzy allh anh nay pany manga tw pany myn shhd mla hwa pysh kya gya۔ as nay kha: \yh bht achhy bat hay، lykn myn nay allh taalyٰ ka hkm sna hay kh as nay ayk qwm kw an ky khwahshat pr tnqyd krtay hwyay kha: 'tmhyn dnya ky zndgy myn apny achhy chyzyn ml gyyn awr tm nay an say ltf andwz hw gyay۔' mjhay dr hay kh hmaray achhay aamal ka slh hmyn dnya myn hy ml jayay۔\"" as lyay as nay asay nhyn pya۔ lam ajydhw، jsay rzyn nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5267","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm nay khybr ky fth say phlay kbhy khjwr nhyn khayy thy۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5268","abdallh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk mrba shkl ky lkyr khynchy awr as kay bych myn ayk lkyr khynch dy jw bahr tk phyly hwyy thy، awr as drmyany lkyr kay knaray pr kchh chhwty lkyryn khynchyn، awr frmaya: ”yh aadmy hay، awr yh as ky mqrrh mdt (mwt) hay jw asay ghyray hwyay hay، awr jw as kay bahr janay ky amyd hay awr agr yh chhwty chhwty lkyryn hyn، tw as ky amyd hay۔ ayk asay yad krta hay، dwsra asay pkrta hay، awr agr wh as say chhwt jata hay tw dwsra asay pkr lyta hay۔\ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5269","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh lkyryn khynchyn awr frmaya: ”yh amyd hay awr yh as ky mwt hay، jb wh as halt myn tha tw achank qryb tryn lkyr as tk phnch jaty hay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5270","ans rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy bwrha hw jata hay lykn as myn dw chyzyn jwan rhty hyn: mal ky khwahsh awr lmby amr ky khwahsh“۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5271","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bwrhay ka dl dw chyzwn myn jwan rhta hay: dnya ky mhbt awr lmby amydwn myn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5272","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay as shkhs kay azr kw dwr kr dya js ky amr as nay draz ky yhan tk kh asay sath sal ky amr tk phncha dya (twbh nh krnay awr nyk aamal nh krnay pr)۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5273","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr ksy aadmy kay pas mal say bhry dw wadyan hwn tw wh tysry tlash kray ga، ansan ka pyt (qbr ky) mty kay swa kwyy chyz nhyn bhrty، awr allh taalyٰ twbh krnay walay ky twbh qbwl krta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5274","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay myray jsm ka ayk hsh pkra awr frmaya: ”dnya myn as trh rhw jysay tm ajnby hw ya msafr، awr apnay aap kw qbrwn kay rhnay walwn myn shmar krw“۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5275","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray pas say gzray awr myn awr myry waldh (hmaray) ghr kay ayk hsay kw plstr kr rhay thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \abdallh! kya hw rha hay؟\"" myn nay jwab dya kh hm (ghr kay) ayk hsay ky mrmt kr rhay hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwt ka maamlh as say bhy tyz tr hay۔ ahmd، trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ shyh، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5276","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jb pyshab krtay tw mty say tymm krtay۔ myn nay kha ya rswl allh! pany aap kay qryb hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay kysay malwm hw skta hay kh myn whan nh phnch skwn۔ shrh alsn، awr abn aljwzy nay asay ktab \alwfa\"" myn rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ shrh alsn myn rwayt hay۔"""
"5277","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh aadmy hay awr yh as ky mwt hay۔ awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apna hath as ky grdn kay pychhay rkha، phr asay khwla awr frmaya: \awr as ky khwahshat hyn۔\"" as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5278","hzrt abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk asa apnay aagay rkha، ayk as ky trf awr ayk faslay pr۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm jantay hw yh kya hay؟ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay jwab dya: allh awr as ka rswl bhtr jantay hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh aadmy hay awr yh as ky mwt ka wqt hay۔ rawy khtay hyn: myra khyal hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \yh as ky amydyn hyn، wh apny amydwn kw pwra krnay ky kwshsh krta hay، lykn as ky amyd pwry hwnay say phlay asay mwt aa jaty hay۔\"" as ka slslh hsn hay۔ shrh alsn myn mrwy hay۔"""
"5279","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah Anhu) Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) se riwayat karte hain, Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Meri Ummat ki umar (oseel se) saath aur sattar saal ke darmiyan hai.\"" (Tirmidhi) aur unhone kaha: Yeh hadees gharib hai. Is ki sanad hasan hai"
"5280","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt ky amryn sath say str sal kay drmyan hyn، awr jw as (sath، str) sal say zyadh hyn an myn say km hyn۔ trmzy، abn majh۔ hsn، asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ awr abdallh bn shkhyr say rwayt ky gyy hdys bymar ky ayadt kay bab myn gzr chky hay۔"
"5281","Amr bin Shu’aib narrates from his father, and he from his grandfather, that the Prophet said: “The first righteousness of this Ummah is (firm) belief in the Hereafter and indifference towards the world, while its first corruption is miserliness and (unlimited) desires.” \nChain: Weak. Narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Shu’ab al-Iman."
"5282","sfyan swry rhmh allh khtay hyn: \khrdray kpray phnna awr khshk sadh khana khana trk nhyn kha jata، blkh khwahshat km rkhna dnya ka trk krna hay۔\"" as ka slslh zayf hay jsay shrh alsn myn rwayt kya gya hay۔"""
"5283","zyd bn hsyn rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn، myn nay amam malk rhm allh alyh say sna، an say pwchha gya kh dnya kw trk krnay say kya mrad hay؟ as nay jwab dya: hlal kmayy awr kchh amydyn rkhna۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5284","Sa'd (Razi Allah Anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah us ameer shakhs se muhabbat karta hai jo parhezgaar aur goomnaam ho.\"" Muslim ne riwayat kiya. Aur Ibn Umar (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat karda hadees: \""Hasad sirf do shakhson ke liye hai\"" Qur'an ki fazilat ke baab mein pehle zikr ho chuki hai."""
"5285","sydna abwbkrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay pwchha ya rswl allh! kwn sa shkhs sb say bhtr hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: \wh js ky amr lmby hw awr js kay aamal achhay hwn (yany qraan w snt kay mtabq)۔\"" as shkhs nay pwchha sb say bra shkhs kwn hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: wh js ky amr lmby hw awr as ka aml bra hw۔ slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5286","It is narrated from Ubayd bin Khalid that the Prophet established brotherhood between two men. One of them was martyred in the way of Allah, and then the other died about a week later. When the companions offered his funeral prayer, the Prophet said: \What supplication did you make for him?\"" They replied: \""We prayed to Allah to forgive him"
"5287","abw kbshh anmary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”tyn khsltyn hyn jn pr myn qsm khata hwn، awr myn tmhyn ayk hdys snata hwn، lhza asay yad rkhw، jn chyzwn ky qsm khata hwn wh yh hyn: sdqh bnday kay mal myn kmy nhyn krta، jb bnday pr zlm kya jayay tw allh taalyٰ as ky azt brhata hay awr jb bnday pr zlm kya jayay tw as ky azt brh jaty hay۔ dwsrwn say mangta hay، allh asay ghryb kr dyta hay، jhan tk myn aap kw btanay ja rha hwn، asay achhy trh yad rkhyn۔\ phr frmaya: dnya char qsm kay lwgwn kay lyay hay: ayk wh bndh jsay allh taalyٰ nay mal awr alm dya hay awr wh as kay baray myn apnay rb say drta hay، rshth daryan nbhata hay awr allh ky rza kay lyay as (alm) kay mtabq aml krta hay، yh aalyٰ drjh hay، dwsra wh bndh hay jsay allh taalyٰ nay alm dya hay mgr mal nhyn، awr as ky nyt achhy hay، wh khta hay: agr myray pas aysa mal hwta tw myn bhy aysa hy khrch krta۔ awr dwsra wh bndh hay jsay allh taalyٰ nay mal dya hay lykn alm nhyn، awr wh nh apnay rb say drta hay، nh khandany talq rkhta hay، awr nh hy as kw shyh twr pr khrch krta hay، awr dwsra wh bndh hay jsay allh taalyٰ nay nh mal dya hay awr nh hy alm hay، awr agr as kay pas mal hwta tw wh aml krta۔ flan flan shkhs srf (brayy) ka aradh rkhta hay awr an dwnwn ka gnah brabr hay۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys shyh hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay، trmzy nay kha۔"""
"5288","sydna ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ jb ksy bnday kay sath bhlayy ka aradh krta hay tw asay (ataat kay kamwn myn) lga dyta hay۔ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! wh asay kysay mlazmt dyta hay؟ aap nay frmaya: \wh asay mwt say phlay nyk aamal krnay ky twfyq ata krta hay۔\"" shyh، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5289","shdad bn aws rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aqlmnd wh hay jw apnay aap kw jwabdh rkhay awr mwt kay bad aanay waly chyzwn kay lyay aml kray، awr bay wqwf wh hay jw apnay nfs kw khwahshat ky pyrwy kray awr allh say amyd lgayay (kh wh ghfwr w rhym hay)۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5290","rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ayk shaby rzy allh anh say rwayt hay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hm ayk mjls myn bythay hwyay thay kh achank rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sr pr pany (yany ghsl say) kay nshan thay۔ hm nay arz kya: ya rswl allh! hm aap kw khwshgwar mwd myn dykhtay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han۔ rawy byan krta hay kh phr lwgwn nay mal ky bhs shrwa kr dy (chahay yh jayz hay ya najayz)۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh say drnay walay kay lyay mal myn kwyy hrj nhyn awr prhyzgar kay lyay sht mal say bhtr hay awr hqyqy khwshy namtwn myn say hay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5291","sfyan swry rhmh allh byan krtay hyn: mazy myn mal kw napsndydh smjha jata tha، jbkh aaj yh mwmn ky dhal hay۔ awr frmaya: agr hmaray pas dynar nh hwtay tw yh badshah hmyn bay wqat smjhtay۔ awr frmaya: js kay hath myn mal hw wh asay astamal kray (awr as kw zaya nh kray) kywnkh yh aysa wqt hay kh agr wh mhtaj hw jayay tw wh phla shkhs hw ga js nay apnay dyn kw dnyawy fayday kay lyay bych dya۔ awr frmaya: hlal mal asraf brdasht nhyn kr skta۔ kmzwr، mstrd؛ shrh alsn myn byan kya gya hay۔"
"5292","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn ayk pkarnay wala pkaray ga: sath sal kay lwg khan hyn؟ awr yh (sath sal) wh amr hay js kay baray myn allh taalyٰ nay frmaya: ’’kya hm nay tmhyn atny amr nhyn dy thy kh jw kwyy nsyht pkrta، awr tmharay pas dranay wala aaya‘‘۔ as ky rwayt ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5293","abdallh bn shdad rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh bnw azrh kay tyn aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwyay awr anhwn nay aslam qbwl kya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myry trf say an kay khanay pynay ka zmh kwn lay ga؟ tlhh rzy allh anh nay kha: myn krwn ga۔ chnanchh wh as kay sath rhay۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk lshkr rwanh kya، an myn say ayk as lshkr kay sath gya awr shhyd hw gya۔ phr as nay ayk awr lshkr rwanh kya awr dwsra aadmy as kay sath chla awr wh bhy shhyd hwgya۔ phr tysra aadmy apnay bstr pr mr gya۔ rawy khtay hyn، tlhh rzy allh anh nay kha: myn nay an tynwn kw jnt myn (khwab myn) dykha، awr jw apnay bstr pr mr gya wh an say aagay tha، jw bad myn shhyd hwa wh as kay sath tha، awr jw phlay shhyd hwa wh dwsray (shhyd) kay sath tha۔ as nay mjhay aljhn myn dal dya، as lyay myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as ka zkr kya، tw aap nay frmaya: \tmhyn as myn kya ajyb bat hay، allh kay nzdyk as mwmn say bhtr kwyy nhyn hay jsay aslam myn lmby amr dy jayay takh wh la alh ala allh khh kr allh ky brayy، brayy awr whdanyt ka aalan kray۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"""
"5294","mhmd bn aby amyrh rzy allh anh، jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay shaby thay، byan krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: agr kwyy bndh apny pydaysh kay dn say lay kr bwrha hw kr mrnay tk allh ky ataat myn sjdh krta rhay، tw wh qyamt kay dn as kw hqyr smjhay ga، takh as ky dnya myn azafh hw skay، takh as kw dnya myn waps bhyj dya jayay۔ maawzh dwnwn rwaytwn kw amam ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5295","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt kay str hzar lwg bghyr hsab kay jnt myn dakhl hwn gay، yh wh lwg hyn jw nh tw rqyh (rwhany shfaa) chahtay hyn، nh shgwn lytay hyn، awr apnay rb pr bhrwsh krtay hyn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5296","Ibn Abbas narrates: One day the Messenger of Allah came and said: \The nations were presented before me. A prophet passed by with one man with him"
"5297","shyb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn ka maamlh hyrt angyz hay، as kay tmam maamlat as kay lyay bhtr hyn، awr yh srf mwmn kay lyay hay، agr asay kwyy bhlayy phnchay tw wh as ka shkr ada krta hay، awr yh as kay lyay bhtr hay، agr asay kwyy nqsan phnchay tw wh as kay lyay bhtr hay awr agr asay kwyy nqsan phnchay tw wh as kay lyay bhtr hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5298","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mzbwt momn kmzwr mwmn say bhtr awr allh kw zyadh mhbwb hay، halankh sb (mwmnwn) myn bhlayy hay، lhza tm as chyz kay lyay kwshsh krw jw tmhyn nfa day، allh say mdd mangw، awr bay bs ya ssty nh krw، awr agr myn nay aysa nh kya hw tw khw: (aysa) hwta، blkh khw: allh nay (yh) fyslh kya، awr jw kchh as nay chaha، kya، kywnkh lfz 'agr' shytan kay kamwn kw khwl dyta hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5299","amr bn khtab rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”agr tm allh pr as trh bhrwsh krw jysa kh as pr bhrwsh krnay ka hq hay tw wh tmhyn as trh rzq day ga jysa kh prndwn kw dyta hay، wh sbh kw bhwkay nkltay hyn awr sham kw pyt bhr kr lwttay hyn۔ hsn، asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5300","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgw، myn nay tmhyn hr as chyz ka hkm dya hay jw tmhyn jnt kay qryb kr day awr tmhyn jhnm say dwr kr day، awr myn nay tmhyn hr as chyz say mna kya hay jw tmhyn jhnm kay qryb kray awr jnt say dwr rkhay۔ rwh alqds nay myray dl myn yh bat daly hay kh kwyy jan as wqt tk nhyn mray gy jb tk kh wh apna rzq pwra nh kr lay allh say drw awr rzq myn takhyr tmhyn allh ky nafrmany kay zryaay hasl krnay pr mjbwr nh krw kywnkh jw kchh allh kay pas hay wh srf as ky ataat say hasl kya ja skta hay۔ shrh alsn، albyhqy nay shab alayman myn، tahm amam byhqy nay \w ana rwh alqdws\"" ka zkr nhyn kya۔ as ka slslh zayf hay، asay shrh alsnn myn awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5301","abwzr rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dnya say knarh kshy ka mtlb hlal kw hram krna awr mal kw zaya krna nhyn hay، blkh dnya say knarh kshy yh hay kh jw kchh tyray hath myn hay wh tyray lyay as say zyadh qablِ aatbar nhyn hay jb kh allh kay hath myn wh amant nh hw jb kh tyray hath myn wh amant nh hw، js ky tmna nh hw۔ aap kay sath aysa nhyn hwa tha، as aaft kay ajr ky amyd myn۔\ (trmzy، abn majh) amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay، awr rawy amrw bn waqd mnkr alhdys hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5302","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh ayk dn myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pychhay (swar) tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lrkay! allh kay ahkam ky hfazt krw، allh tmhary hfazt kray ga، allh kay hqwq ka khyal rkhw، tm asay apnay samnay pao gay، awr jb tm mangw tw srf allh say mangw، jb tm allh say mdd mangw tw pwry qwm ml kr mdd mangty hay، awr jb tm allh say mdd mangtay hw tw pwry qwm kw malwm hwta hay۔ ksy chyz say wh tmhyn faydh nhyn phncha sktay mgr as kay jw allh nay tmharay lyay lkh dya hay awr agr wh tmhyn nqsan phnchanay kay lyay akthay hw jayyn tw wh tmhyn nqsan nhyn phncha sktay mgr as kay kh jw allh nay tmharay lyay lkh dya hay awr wh khshk hw chkay hyn۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5303","sydna sad rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aadmy ky khwsh qsmty yh hay kh wh allh kay apnay baray myn hkm pr razy hw jayay، ansan ky bdqsmty yh hay kh wh allh say bhlayy ky tlb kw chhwr day، awr aadmy ky bdqsmty yh hay kh wh allh kay hkm pr razy nh hw۔ ahmd، trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5304","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay sath njd ky trf ayk mhm myn shrkt ky۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm waps aayay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm bhy aap kay sath waps aayay۔ shabh kram kw dwphr kay wqt ayk ghnay kantay dar drkhtwn say bhry wady myn nynd nay aaghwsh myn lay lya۔ chnanchh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay whan (aaram kay lyay) prao dala awr shabh kram drkhtwn kay sayay ky tlash myn mntshr hw gyay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay bbwl kay ayk drkht kay nychay dyrh dala awr as pr apny tlwar ltkayy awr hm thwry dyr kay lyay sw gyay۔ achank rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmyn pkarnay lgay۔ hm nay dykha kh ayk aaraby as kay sath tha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as nay myry tlwar mjh pr khynch ly jb myn aaram kr rha tha، myn bydar hwa tw tlwar as kay hath myn bnd thy، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tmhyn mjh say kwn bchayay ga؟ myn nay tyn bar kha: 'allh (myry hfazt kray ga)'۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay ksy bat pr nhyn jhrka awr byth gyay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5305","awr abwbkr asmaayly nay apny shyh myn as trh byan kya hay: aap nay frmaya: \tmhyn mjh say kwn bchayay ga؟\"" aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: allh! as kay hath say tlwar gr gyy، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tlwar lay ly awr frmaya: tmhyn mjh say kwn bchayay ga؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm sb say bhtr pkrnay walay hw، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm gwahy dytay hw kh allh kay swa kwyy abadt kay layq nhyn awr myn allh ka rswl hwn؟ as nay jwab dya: nhyn، lykn myn tm say wadh krta hwn kh myn tm say jng nhyn krwn ga awr nh hy an lwgwn ky hmayt krwn ga jw tm say lryn gay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay chhwr dya (aazad kr dya)۔ wh (aaraby) apnay sathywn kay pas waps gya awr kha: myn tmharay pas bhtryn lwgwn myn say aaya hwn۔ asy trh ktab alhmydy awr ryaz alsalhyn myn bhy hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay nwwy nay ryaz alsalhyn myn awr byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5306","sydna abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn ayk aayt janta hwn kh agr lwg as pr aml kryn tw yh an kay lyay kafy hw jayay gy: ”jw allh say drta hay، allh as kay lyay (hr mshkl say) nklnay ka rasth bna dyta hay، awr asay aysy jgh say rzq dyta hay jhan say asay gman bhy nhyn hwta“۔ asay ahmd، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5307","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay yh aayt prhayy: ”bay shk myn hy akyla rzq dynay wala، taqt awr taqt ka malk hwn۔ abwdaod، trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ shyh، asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5308","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn dw bhayy thay۔ an myn say ayk rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwta tha awr dwsra karwbar myn mshghwl rhta tha۔ karwbar krnay walay nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say apnay bhayy ky shkayt ky۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”shayd tmhyn as ky wjh say rzq dya gya hw“۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys shyh ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5309","amrw bn alaas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk ansan kay dl myn hr wady ka ayk hsh hay، jw shkhs apnay dl kw as kay tmam hswn ky pyrwy krnay day، allh taalyٰ kw as ky kwyy prwah nhyn hay، chahay wh asay ksy wady myn hy hlak kr day، awr jw shkhs allh pr bhrwsh krta hay، wh as ky trf say kfayt krta hay“۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5310","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmharay rb qadrِ mtlq nay frmaya hay kh agr myray bnday myry ataat kryn gay tw myn rat kw an pr barsh brsaon ga awr dn kw an pr swrj chmkaon ga awr anhyn grj ky aawaz nh snnay dwn ga۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5311","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy apnay ghr walwn kay pas gya، jb as nay an ky (bhwk) zrwrt dykhy tw shra ky trf nkl gya۔ jb as ky bywy nay yh dykha tw chky kay pas ja kr asay drst kya awr tnwr kay pas ja kr asay rwshn kya۔ phr awrt nay daa ky kh aay allh hmyn rzq ata frma۔ as nay dykha kh achank tb (aatay say) bhr gya hay۔ rawy khta hay: wh tnwr kay pas gyy awr asay bhy (rwty say) bhra hwa paya۔ rawy khta hay: jb shwhr waps aaya tw as nay pwchha kh kya myray bad tmhyn kchh mla؟ bywy nay kha han! hmaray rb ky trf say۔ wh chky kay pthr pr gya (asay dykhnay kay lyay)۔ as ka zkr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr wh chky nh athata tw yh qyamt tk chlta rhta۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5312","abw drdaa rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk rzq bnday kw as trh dhwndta hay js trh as ky mwt asay dhwndty hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abw naym nay hly alawlyaa myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5313","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh gwya myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw dykh rha hwn kh wh nbywn myn say ayk nby ka waqah byan kr rhay hyn۔ as ky qwm nay asay mara awr zkhmy kr dya awr wh apnay chhray say khwn pwnchh rha tha kh aay allh myry qwm kw maaf kr day kywnkh wh nhyn jantay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5314","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ tmhary swrtwn awr malwn kw nhyn dykhta، blkh wh tmharay dlwn awr tmharay aamal kw dykhta hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5315","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ frmata hay: myn shrk say sb say zyadh bay nyaz hwn، js nay kwyy aysa aml kya js myn wh myray sath ksy awr kw shryk thhrayay tw myn as kw awr as kay shrk kw chhwr dyta hwn۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: ’’myn as (aml krnay walay) say bry hwn، (aml) as kay lyay hay js kay lyay as nay yh kya‘‘۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5316","Jundub narrates that the Messenger of Allah said: \Whoever performs a deed for the sake of fame"
"5317","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha gya kh hmyn btayyay kh ayk aadmy achha kam krta hay awr lwg as ky taryf krtay hyn۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \lwg as kw psnd krtay hyn۔\"" (as ka kya hkm hay؟) rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh mwmn kay lyay pyshgy bshart hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5318","abwsayd bn aby fzlh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ lwgwn kw qyamt kay dn jma kray ga js myn kwyy shk nhyn tw ayk aalan krnay wala aalan kray ga kh js nay ksy aysay kam myn shryk kya jw as nay akylay allh kay lyay kya hw tw asay chahyay kh wh allh kay swa ksy awr say bay nyaz hw، asay chahyay kh wh as kay bdlay myn allh taalyٰ say sb say zyadh shryk hw۔ shrk (as kay sath shrk krna)۔ hsn، ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5319","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw shkhs apnay aamal lwgwn kay samnay dkhayay ga، allh taalyٰ asay apny mkhlwq kay samnay sna day ga، awr asay zlyl w rswa kray ga“۔ shyh، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5320","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js ky nyt aakhrt ky hw، allh taalyٰ as kay dl kw mtmyn kr dyta hay، as kay maamlat kw trtyb dyta hay، awr dnya as kay pas aajzy kay sath aaty hay، awr js ky nyt dnya ky tlb hwty hay، allh taalyٰ as ky nzrwn kay samnay dnya، mhtajy awr tngdsty nhyn rkh dyta۔ swayay as kay jw allh nay as kay lyay lkh dya hay۔\ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5321","amam darmy nay asay aban ky snd say zyd bn sabt rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔ mstnd، aldarmy nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5322","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay arz kya ya rswl allh! jb myn apnay ghr myn nmaz ky chtayy pr hwn، achank ayk aadmy myray pas aata hay awr mjhay wh halt psnd hay js myn wh mjhay dykhta hay (kya yh bhy zahr hay؟) rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \abwhryrh! allh tm pr rhm kray، tmharay lyay dwhra ajr hay: pwshydh ka ajr awr zahr ka ajr۔\"" (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5323","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aakhry zmanh myn kchh lwg aysay hwn gay jw dyn kay bdlay dnya chahyn gay، wh lwgwn kw khwsh krnay kay lyay bkrywn ky khalyn phnyn gay، an ky zbanyn shkr say zyadh mythy hwn gy، awr allh taalyٰ frmata hay kh an kay dl khwsh mzaj hwn gay“۔ (yh swch kr kh myn anhyn mhlt day rha hwn) ya wh myray khlaf hmt kryn، myn apny zat ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn an myn say aysay lwgwn pr aazmaysh bhyjwn ga jw an kay shryf awr brdbar lwgwn kw bhy pryshan kr day ga۔\ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5324","abn amr rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh tbark w taalyٰ nay frmaya: ”myn nay aysy mkhlwq pyda ky hay js ky zban shkr say zyadh mythy hay awr js kay dl msbbr say zyadh krway hyn، mjhay apny zat ky qsm myn anhyn aysay shkhs pr dalwn ga jw an ky aazmaysh myn mbtla hwn gay awr wh sbr krnay walay hwn gay۔ myry wjh say dhwkh dya gya ya wh myray khlaf jrt krtay hyn؟‘‘ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5325","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk hr chyz ka jwsh awr wlwlh hwta hay، awr hr jwsh w wlwlay kay sath kmzwry awr ssty ka dwr bhy hwta hay، agr jwsh rkhnay wala jwsh ky trf brhay tw aatdal kw brqrar rkhay awr amyd say prhyz kray tw angly ky trf asharh krnay say bchta hay۔ wh (mshhwr hw jayay)، phr asay shmar nh krw۔\ hsn، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5326","ans rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy kay brayy kay lyay yhy kafy hay kh as kay dyn ya dnya kay maamlat myn as ky trf anglyan athayy jayyn (wh bdnam hw jayay) swayay as kay js ky allh hfazt kray۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5327","abw tmymh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn sfwan rzy allh anh awr an kay sathywn kay pas mwjwd tha awr jndb rzy allh anh anhyn nsyht awr nsyht kr rhay thay۔ anhwn nay pwchha: kya tm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kchh sna hay؟ anhwn nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: js nay shhrt ky khatr kwyy aml kya، allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn rswa kray ga، awr js nay apnay aap kw tngy myn dala، allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn mshqt myn dalay ga۔ anhwn nay kha: hmyn nsyht krw۔ aap nay frmaya: ansan kay jsm myn sb say phlay as ka madh fasd hwta hay، lhza jw shkhs srf hlal khanay ky asttaat rkhta hw wh aysa kray، awr jw as bat pr qadr hw kh as kay awr jnt kay drmyan ayk mthy bhr khwn kay alawh kwyy chyz hayl nh hw jsay as nay hram tryqay say bhaya hw، tw asay chahyay kh wh hram khwn bhanay say prhyz kray۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5328","It is narrated from Umar bin Khattab that one day he came towards the mosque of the Messenger, and he saw Mu'adh bin Jabal crying near the grave of the Prophet. He asked him: \What is making you cry?\"" He replied: \""What is making me cry is something I heard from the Messenger of Allah. I heard the Messenger say: 'Even a small amount of showing off is shirk (associating partners with Allah)"
"5329","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”byshk jb bndh khlay aam nmaz prhta hay tw asay achhy trh ada krta hay awr jb khlwt myn nmaz prhta hay tw asay bhy achhy trh ada krta hay، allh taalyٰ ka arshad hay: yh myra mkhls bndh hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5330","sydna maaz bn jbl rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aakhry dwr myn kchh lwg aysay hwn gay jw zahry twr pr dwst hwn gay lykn batn myn dshmn hwn gay۔ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! yh kysay hw ga؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh bahmy khwahsh (yany fayday kay lyay) awr bahmy khwf (yany nqsan kay) ky wjh say hw ga۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5331","shdad bn aws rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: js nay dkhaway kay lyay nmaz prhy as nay shrk kya، js nay dkhaway kay lyay rwzh rkha as nay shrk kya، awr js nay dkhaway kay lyay sdqh kya as nay shrk kya۔ dwnwn ahadys kw amam ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5332","shdad bn aws rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh wh rwnay lgay۔ as say pwchha gya kh tmhyn rwnay ky kya wjh hay؟ anhwn nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say jw sna، jb mjhay yad aaya tw as nay mjhay rwna shrwa kr dya، myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: myn apny amt kay lyay shrk awr pwshydh khwahshat say drta hwn، rawy khtay hyn: myn nay arz kya ya rswl allh! kya aap kay bad aap ky amt shrk kray gy؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han، lykn wh swrj awr chand ky prstsh nhyn kryn gay، nh pthrwn awr btwn ky، blkh apnay aamal kw zahr kryn gay، awr pwshydh khwahsh yh hay kh an myn say kwyy sbh ka rwzh shrwa kray، lykn phr as ky khwahshat myn say ayk khwahsh as kay samnay aajayay tw wh rwzh twr day ga۔ zayf، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5333","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray pas tshryf layay jb hm msyh djal kay baray myn gftgw kr rhay thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya myn tmhyn aysy chyz nh btaon js kay baray myn mjhay tm pr msyh djal say bhy zyadh khwf hay؟ hm nay arz kya: ya rswl allh! brah krm hmyn btayyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \pwshydh shrk: yh wh hay jb aadmy nmaz prh rha hw، awr jb dykhay kh kwyy asay dykh rha hay، tw nmaz kw lmba kr dyta hay (nmaz kw dhymay qrt say lmba kr dyta hay)۔\"" hsn، abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5334","mhmwd bn lbyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay tmharay baray myn sb say zyadh js chyz ka khwf hay wh chhwta shrk hay۔ anhwn nay arz kya ya rswl allh! mamwly shrk say kya mrad hay؟ aap (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay frmaya: dkhawa (rya)۔ awr amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn as azafay kw nql kya hay: \js dn allh taalyٰ apnay bndwn kw an kay aamal ka bdlh day ga، an say frmayay ga: tm an lwgwn kay pas jao jn kay samnay tm dnya myn apnay aamal dkhatay thay، awr dykhw kh tm an kay pas kwyy ajr ya bhlayy patay hw؟\"" as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5335","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy pthr kay andr kwyy aysa aml kray js ka nh kwyy drwazh hw awr nh khrky، tw wh aml jw bhy hw، lwgwn pr zahr hw jata hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5336","asman bn afan rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js shkhs myn kwyy achhy ya bry khslt chhpy hwyy hw tw allh taalyٰ as myn say ayk nshany zahr kr dyta hay js say wh phchana jayay ga۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5337","amr bn khtab rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn as amt kay lyay hr mnafq say drta hwn، kywnkh wh hkmt say bat krta hay lykn zlm say kam lyta hay۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn tynwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ hsn kw byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5338","mhajr bn hbyb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ frmata hay: myn aqlmnd ky hr bat kw qbwl nhyn krta، lykn myn as ky nyt awr as kay araday kw qbwl krta hwn، agr as ky nyt awr mqsd myry ataat myn hw tw myn as ky khamwshy kw smjhta hwn، khwah as nay myry khamwshy kw pra kay lyay nhyn smjha۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5339","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh abwalqasm rzy allh anh awr an kay ghr walwn nay frmaya: as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، agr tm (nafrmanwn ky sza kay baray myn) wh jan lytay jw myn janta hwn tw tm zyadh rwtay awr km hnstay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5340","am alaalyٰ ansaryh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \allh ky qsm! myn nhyn janta، allh ky qsm! myn nhyn janta، halankh myn allh ka rswl hwn، myray sath awr aap kay sath kya slwk kya jayay ga؟\"" asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5341","sydna jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray samnay jhnm ky aag pysh ky gyy، myn nay as myn bny asrayyl ky ayk awrt kw bly ky wjh say azab myn mbtla dykha، as nay asay bandh rkha tha، nh asay khwd khlaya awr nh asay janay dya kh wh asay kha skty thy، awr myn nay as halt myn zmyn kay kyray maray dykhay۔ amrw bn aamr alkhzaay jhnm myn apny aantyn ghsyttay hwyay awr wh phla shkhs tha js nay btwn kay nam pr janwrwn kw aazad krnay ka rwaj shrwa kya۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5342","sydh zynb bnt jhsh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh ayk dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray pas aztrab ky halt myn tshryf layay awr frma rhay thay: allh kay swa kwyy abadt kay layq nhyn، arbwn kay lyay afsws hay ayk brayy ky wjh say jw qryb aachky hay، aaj as myn mqry kay brabr bra swrakh hw gya hay awr as myn ayk swrakh kr dya gya hay۔ awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay angwthay awr shhadt ky angly say ayk hlqh bnaya۔ zynb rzy allh anha khty hyn kh myn nay arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kya hm hlak hw jayyn gay jb kh hm myn nyk lwg hwn gay؟ aap (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay frmaya: han jb bdkary ghalb hwjayay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5343","Abu Amir or Abu Malik Ash'ari narrates: I heard the Messenger of Allah say: \There will be people in my Ummah who will consider khaz (a light type of silk) and regular silk"
"5344","Ibn Umar, may Allah be pleased with him, narrates that the Messenger of Allah said: \When Allah sends punishment upon a people"
"5345","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr bnday kw as aakhry aml pr athaya jayay ga jw as nay mwt say phlay kya tha۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5346","Abu Hurairah narrates that the Messenger of Allah said: \I have not seen anything like Hell from which the one fleeing is in such heedlessness"
"5347","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw myn dykhta hwn tm nhyn dykhtay، awr jw snta hwn، tm nhyn sntay، aasman srk gya hay، awr as myn hr trh ky kraht hay، as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، allh taalyٰ kay sr myn char anglywn ky jgh nhyn hay swayay as kay kh as kay sr myn char anglyan lgayy jayyn! agr tm wh jan lytay jw myn janta hwn tw tm bht km hnstay awr zyadh rwtay، bstrwn pr awrtwn say ltf andwz hwna chhwr dytay awr khlay mydanwn myn allh say fryad krtay hwyay nkl jatay۔ abwzr rzy allh anh nay kha kh kash myn ayk drkht hwta jw kata jata۔ hsn، asay ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5348","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs (rat kay aakhry hsay myn sfr krtay hwyay khtray say) drta hay wh rat kay abtdayy hsay myn sfr shrwa krta hay awr jw rat kay awayl myn sfr krta hay wh apny mnzl pr phnch jata hay، aagah rhw، allh ky tjart allh ky dy hwyy jnt hay، khbrdar rhw! zayf، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5349","ans rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” allh taalyٰ frmayay ga: hr as shkhs kw jhnm ky aag say nkal dw js nay mjhay ayk dn bhy yad kya hw، ya js nay ksy jgh mjh say dra hw“۔ hsn asay trmzy awr byhqy nay ktab albas w alnshwr myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5350","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as aayt kay baray myn pwchha: \jw dytay hyn why dytay hyn awr an kay dl drtay hyn\""۔ myn nay pwchha kya yh wh lwg hyn jw shrab pytay hyn awr chwry krtay hyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""aay schay ky byty! nhyn، blkh yh wh hyn jw rwzh rkhtay hyn، nmaz prhtay hyn awr sdqh krtay hyn، awr anhyn dr hay kh khyn an say qbwl nh hw jayay، yhy lwg nykywn myn jldy krtay hyn۔\"" hsn، asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5351","aby bn kab rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka mamwl tha kh jb rat dw thayy gzr jaty tw aap khray hw jatay awr frmatay: lwgw allh kw yad krw، allh ka zkr krw، zlzlh aanay wala hay، as kay fwraً bad ayk awr zlzlh aanay wala hay، awr as ky skhty kay sath mwt aayy awr as ky skhty awr mwt aa gyy۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5352","abw sayd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nmaz kay lyay tshryf layay tw lwgwn kw dykha kh wh hns rhay hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw agr tm lztwn kw khtm krnay walay (mwt) kw ksrt say yad krw gay tw yh tmhyn as say dwr rkhay ga jw myn nay dykha hay، lhza lztwn kw khtm krnay walay yany mwt kw ksrt say yad kya krw، kywnkh qbr hr rwz khty hay: myn ajb ka ghr hwn، myn hy ghr ka ghr hwn، myn ghr ka dwlwn hwn۔ kyray awr hshrat alarz jb ksy mwmn bnday kw dfn kya jata hay tw qbr as say khty hay: jw lwg mjh pr chltay thay an myn say tm sb say zyadh mhbwb thay aaj tm myray pas aayay hw، tw dykhw myn tm say kya slwk krta hwn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as kay lyay jhan tk as ky nzr phnchty hay wsya kr dy jaty hay، awr as kay lyay jnt ka ayk drwazh khwl dya jata hay، awr jb kwyy fasq bndh ya kafr dfn hwta hay tw qbr asay khty hay: tyra astqbal nhyn، mjh pr chlnay walay tmam lwgwn myn say tw mjh say sb say zyadh nfrt krnay wala tha، aaj tjhay myray sprd kya gya hay، tw anqryb tjhay dykhwn ga kh myn tyray sath kya slwk krwn ga۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh as kay lyay tng hw jata hay yhan tk kh as ky pslyan aaps myn jr jaty hyn۔ rawy khtay hyn: awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk hath ky anglywn kw dwsray hath ky anglywn myn mla kr as ka sbwt dya awr frmaya: as pr str sanp chrhay hwyay hyn، awr agr an myn say ayk zmyn pr phwnk day tw jb tk dnya baqy rhay gy kchh nhyn pyda kray ga، wh katyn gay awr phar dyn gay yhan tk kh as ka hsab lya jayay ga۔ rawy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qbr ya tw jnt kay baghwn myn say ayk bagh hay ya jhnm kay grhwn myn say ayk grha hay۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5353","abw jhyfh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh shabh nay arz kya ya rswl allh aap bwrhay hw gyay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: swrh hwd awr as jysy swrtwn nay mjhay bwrha kr dya hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5354","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh abwbkr rzy allh anh nay arz kya ya rswl allh aap bwrhay hw gyay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: swrh hwd، alwaqah، almrslat، am ytsalwn awr swr alshms nay mjhay bwrha kr dya hay۔ (trmzy) awr hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ’’wh jhnm myn dakhl nhyn hwga‘‘۔ jhad kay bab myn mzkwr hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5355","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay، anhwn nay kha: tm aysay kam krtay hw jw tmhary nzr myn ayk bal say bhy zyadh baryk hwtay hyn (yany anthayy hqyr) jbkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn hm an kw tbah kn smjhtay thay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5356","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aayshh! chhwtay gnahwn say bhy bchw، kywnkh an gnahwn pr allh taalyٰ say (sza) mangnay wala bhy hay۔ shyh، asay abn majh، aldarmy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5357","abw brdh bn abw mwsyٰ khtay hyn kh abdallh bn amr rzy allh anhma nay mjh say kha: kya tm jantay hw kh myray wald nay tmharay wald say kya kha؟ as nay kha: myn nhyn janta۔ anhwn nay kha: myray wald nay aap kay wald say kha: abw mwsy، kya aap kw yh psnd hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky shbt myn hmara aslam، aap sly allh alyh wslm ky shbt myn hmary hjrt، aap ky shbt myn hmary kwshsh، awr jw aamal hm nay aap kay sath kyay wh sb hmaray lyay qaym w daym rhyn، awr jw aamal hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay bad kyay، an kay bdlay myn hm brabr nh rhyn؟ as pr aap kay wald nay myray wald say kha: nhyn، allh ky qsm! rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay bad hm nay jhad kya، nmazyn prhyn، rwzay rkhay، bht say nyk aamal kyay awr bht say lwgwn nay hmaray hath pr aslam qbwl kya، awr hm an aamal kay ajr ky amyd rkhtay hyn۔ myray wald nay kha: lykn myn as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn amr rzy allh anh ky jan hay، as bat kw trjyh dyta hwn kh wh aamal (jw hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath kyay thay) hmaray lyay qaym rhyn awr jw aamal hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay bad kyay hyn an kay brabr njat hasl kryn۔ myn (abw brdh) nay kha: bay shk tmharay wald (amr rzy allh anh) allh ky qsm! myray wald say bhtr tha. asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5358","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray rb nay mjhay nw batwn ka hkm dya hay: chhpay awr zahr myn allh say drna، ghsh hw ya khwsh hw، sch bwlna، ghryby awr dwlt myn aatdal akhtyar krna، mjh say ktnay walwn kay sath talqat rkhna، mjh say mhrwmy krnay walwn kw maaf krna، myry batwn say mhrwm rhnay walwn kw maaf krna، awr myry batwn myn kmy lanay walwn kw maaf krna۔ (allh ka zkr)، myry nzr sbq lynay kay lyay hay، awr yh kh myn nyky ka hkm dyta hwn۔\ mjhay yh nhyn mla، rzyn nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5359","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy mwmn bnday ky aankh say allh kay khwf say aansw nklyn، chahay wh mkhy kay sr kay brabr hy kywn nh hwn، phr wh as kay chhray pr bhh jayyn tw allh taalyٰ as shkhs pr jhnm ky aag kw hram kr dyta hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5360","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwg (apnay halat awr khswsyat kay lhaz say) sw awntwn ky mannd hyn jn myn say tm kw ayk bhy swary kay qabl nhyn mlay ga۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5361","abwsayd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm yqynaً apnay say phlay walwn kay tryqay pr chlw gay، js trh ayk twaf dwsray say awr ayk hath dwsray hath kay brabr hay، as trh kh agr wh chhpkly kay swrakh myn dakhl hw jayyn tw tm as myn an kay pychhay chlw gay۔ pwchha gya ya rswl allh! kya hm say phlay yhwd w nsaryٰ hyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \awr kwn hw skta hay؟\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""
"5362","myrdas aslmy rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” nyk lwg ayk ayk kr kay chlay jayyn gay، awr jw ky bhwsy ya khjwr kay kwray ky trh nakarh lwg rh jayyn gay، jn ky allh kay nzdyk kwyy qdr nhyn hw gy۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5363","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb myry amt mtkbranh chal akhtyar kray gy awr badshahwn kay bytay (yany fars awr rwm kay shhzaday) an kay bnday bn jayyn gay tw allh taalyٰ as (amt) kay shryrwn kw as amt pr mslt kr day ga۔ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5364","hzyfh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt as wqt tk qaym nhyn hw gy jb tk tm apnay khlyfh kw qtl nh krw gay، aaps myn lrw gay awr ayk dwsray kw qtl nhyn krw gay awr tmharay bray lwg tmhary dnya kay wars bn jayyn gay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5365","hzyfh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt as wqt tk qaym nhyn hw gy jb tk kh sb say zlyl awr zlyl wh shkhs nh hw ga jw dnya ka sb say bra hsh (as kay mal w asbab awr ahday) pr fayz hw ga۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5366","mhmd bn kab qrzy khtay hyn kh js shkhs nay aly bn aby talb rzy allh anh say sna، anhwn nay mjh say byan kya، anhwn nay kha: hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath msjd myn bythay hwyay thay kh achank msab bn amyr rzy allh anh hmaray pas aayay۔ as nay srf ayk chadr phn rkhy thy، js pr chmray kay dhbay thay۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn dykha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm ky sabqh halt awr mwjwdh halt myn frq dykh kr rwnay lgay۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmhara kya hal hw ga jb tm myn say kwyy ayk kpray ka ayk syt sbh kw awr dwsra sham kw phnay ga، tmharay dstrkhwan pr ayk brtn rkh dya jayay ga awr dwsra atar dya jayay ga، awr tm apnay ghrwn kw (prdwn awr aarayshwn say) as trh dhanp lw gay js trh kabh kw (kprwn say) dhanp dya jata hay؟ shabh nay arz kya ya rswl allh! as wqt hm aaj say bhtr hwn gay۔ hm abadt kay lyay aazad hwn gay awr kam say fargh hwn gay (nwkr kam kryn gay)۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nhyn، aaj tm as wqt say bhtr hw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5367","ans rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn pr ayk aysa zmanh aayay ga kh apnay dyn pr sabt qdm rhnay wala as shkhs ky trh hw ga js kay hath myn jlta hwa angarh hw۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: as hdys ky snd ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5368","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tmharay srdar tm myn sb say achhay hwn، tmharay maldar skhy hwn، awr tmharay maamlat bahmy mshwray say tay hwn tw zmyn ky sth tmharay lyay as kay andrwny hsay say bhtr hay (yany zndgy mwt say bhtr hay) awr jb tmhary hkwmtyn bdtr hyn awr tmharay mal bdtmyz hyn۔ awrtwn kay sprd hay tw zmyn ka andrwny hsh tmharay lyay as ky sth say bhtr hay (yany mwt zndgy say bhtr hay)۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5369","swban rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh wqt qryb hay jb (gmrah) qwmyn ayk dwsray kw tmharay khlaf blayyn gy js trh khanay walay ayk dwsray kw tshtry kay lyay pkartay hyn۔ ksy nay pwchha: kya as ky wjh yh hay kh hm as dn tadad myn km hwn gay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nhyn، blkh as dn tm bht hw gay lykn tm sylab ky jhag ky trh hw gay، allh taalyٰ tmharay dshmnwn kay dlwn say tmhara khwf nkal day ga awr tmharay dlwn myn whn dal day ga۔ ksy nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! 'whn' kya hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: dnya ky mhbt awr mwt say nfrt۔ hsn kw abw daod awr byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5370","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn: jb ksy qwm myn bay aymany phyl jaty hay tw allh taalyٰ an kay dlwn myn khwf dal dyta hay۔ jb ksy qwm myn zna phylta hay tw an myn amwat brh jaty hyn۔ jb lwg nap twl myn dhwkh dytay hyn tw an ka rzq rwk lya jata hay۔ jb lwg ghyr mnsfanh fyslay krnay lgtay hyn tw an myn bray pymanay pr qtl w ghart gry hwty hay۔ awr jb kwyy qwm apnay ahd kw twrty hay tw an pr dshmn mslt hw jatay hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ malk nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5371","It is narrated from ‘Iyad bin Himar al-Mujashi‘i that one day the Messenger of Allah said in his sermon: “Listen! My Lord has commanded me to teach you what He has taught me today, things which you did not know. All wealth that I have bestowed upon any servant is lawful. I have created all My servants as Hunafa (those who keep away from falsehood and are ready to accept the truth). Indeed, the devils come to them and turn them away from their religion, and they make unlawful for them what I had made lawful for them, and they command them to associate with Me that for which I have sent down no authority. Indeed, Allah looked at the people of the earth and detested them, both Arabs and non-Arabs, except for some remnants from the People of the Book. And He said: I have only sent you so that I may test you and test (your people) through you. I have sent down upon you a Book which water cannot wash away (it is unalterable); you will recite it while asleep and awake. Indeed, Allah has commanded me to destroy Quraysh, so I said: My Lord! They will crush my head and make it like bread. He said: Expel them as they expelled you, and fight them, We will support you. Spend, and you will be provided for. Send forth an army, and We will send five armies (of angels) like it. And you (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) will fight the disobedient with your obedient followers.” \nNarrated by Muslim."
"5372","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn: jb yh aayt nazl hwyy: \awr apnay qryby rshth darwn kw khbrdar krw\"" tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sfa phar pr chrhay awr pkarnay lgay: bnw fhr bnw ady! (jw qrysh kay qbayl hyn) yhan tk kh wh akthay hw gyay۔ phr as nay kha: \""mjhay btao، agr myn tmhyn btaon kh wady myn ayk lshkr tm pr hmlh krna chahta hay، tw kya tm myry bat pr yqyn krw gay؟\"" anhwn nay kha: han، hm nay aap kw hmyshh scha paya hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tmhyn skht azab say phlay dranay wala hwn۔ abw lhb nay kha: \""tmhara dn baqy rh jayay، kya tm nay hmyn asy lyay aktha kya؟\"" phr swrh (tbt yda aby lhbn w tba) ’’abw lhb kay hath brbad hw awr wh brbad hw‘‘ nazl hwyy۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay kh aap nay pkara: \""bnw abd mnaf! myry awr tmhary msal as shkhs ky sy hay jw dshmn kw dykh kr apnay ahl w ayal kw bchanay kay lyay nkla، as dr say kh dshmn as say phlay an tk phnch jayay ga، as lyay as nay zwr say pkarna shrwa kr dya: ya sbahh!\"" mtfq hw gyay۔"""
"5373","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb yh aayt nazl hwyy: \awr apnay qryby rshth darwn kw khbrdar krw\"" tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qrysh kw blaya awr wh sb jma hw gyay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aam awr khas sb kw mkhatb kr kay frmaya: aay bnw kab bn lwyy! apnay aap kw jhnm ky aag say bchao۔ aay bnw mrh bn kab! apnay aap kw aag say bchao۔ aay bnw abd shms! apnay aap kw aag say bchao۔ aay bnw abdalmtlb! apnay aap kw aag say bchao۔ fatmh! apnay aap kw aag say bchao۔ myn allh kay hzwr tmharay lyay kchh krnay ka akhtyar nhyn rkhta، swayay as kay kh myn slh rhmy kay sath rshth dary kw qaym rkhwn۔ awr shyh bkhary awr shyh mslm ky rwayt myn hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aay qrysh kay grwh! apny janwn kw (ayman lay kr aag say) bchao۔ myn allh kay samnay tmharay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta۔ aay bnw abd mnaf! myn allh kay samnay tmharay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta۔ abas bn abd almtlb! myn allh kay samnay tmharay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khalh sfyh! myn allh kay samnay tmharay lyay kchh nhyn kr skta۔ fatmh bnt mhmd! myray mal myn say jw chahw lay lw، myn allh kay samnay tmharay lyay kchh nhyn krskta۔ asay mslm awr bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"5374","Abu Musa narrates: The Messenger of Allah said: \This Ummah of mine is an Ummah upon whom mercy has been shown; it will not have (severe) punishment in the Hereafter. Its punishment in this world will be in the form of trials"
"5375","abw abydh awr maaz bn jbl rzy allh anhma rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as dyn ky abtdaa nbwt awr rhmt say hwyy، phr khlaft awr rhmt hw gy، phr jabr badshah hwn gay، phr jbr hw ga، zmyn pr ghlw hw ga، zmyn pr ghlw hw ga، awr zmyn pr zlm hw ga۔ shrab kay hlal hwnay kay lyay anhyn asy halt myn rzq dya jayay ga awr allh say mlnay tk mdd mlty rhay gy۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5376","Abu Ubaidah and Mu’adh bin Jabal narrated from the Messenger of Allah, that he said: \This religion began with prophethood and mercy"
"5377","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \bay shk sb say phlay altnay waly chyz hwgy...\"" rawy zyd bn yhyyٰ rzy allh anh nay kha: aslam ka mtlb hay js trh brtn alt dya jata hay، yany shrab۔ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! allh as maamlay kw phlay hy wazh kr chka hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: wh as ka nam bdl dyn gay awr phr asay hlal smjhyn gay۔"""
"5378","Nu’man bin Bashir narrates from Hudhayfah, who said: The Messenger of Allah said: “Prophethood will remain among you as long as Allah wills, then Allah will remove it when He wills. Then there will be a Caliphate on the pattern of Prophethood for as long as Allah wills, then Allah will remove it when He wills. Then there will be biting kingship for as long as Allah wills, then Allah will remove it when He wills. Then there will be coercive kingship for as long as Allah wills, then Allah will remove it when He wills. Then there will be a Caliphate on the pattern of Prophethood.” Then he fell silent. Habib narrates: When ‘Umar bin ‘Abd al-‘Aziz assumed the Caliphate, I wrote this hadith to remind him, and said: I hope that after the oppressive kingship and coercive kingship, you are the Commander of the Faithful. He was pleased with this and liked it. \nChain: Authentic. Narrated by Ahmad and al-Bayhaqi in Dala’il al-Nubuwwah."
